  "content": "[Intro]\n[Esus4]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n[Esus4]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Esus4]\nStanding by the\nwindow\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\nEyes upon the\n[Am7]moon\n[Bsus4]\n[Esus4]\nHoping that the\nmemory\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]Will\nleave his spirit\n[Am7]soon\n[Bsus4]She\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am7]shuts the doors and\n[Bm7]lights And lays her\n[Em7]body on the bed\n[C9]Where\n[Am7]images and words\n[Bm7]are Running deep\n[Em7]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]She has too much\n[Bm7]pride to pull The\n[Em7]sheets above her head\n[C9]So\n[Am7]quietly she\n[Bm7]lays and waits For\n\n[Bridge]\n[Esus4]sleep\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Esus4]She\nstares at the\nceiling And tries\nnot to think\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n[B7sus4]\n[Esus4]And\npictures the chains\nShe's been try-\ning to link\n[Cmaj7]again\nBut the\n[Am7]feeling is gone\n[B7sus4]And\n\n[Chorus]\n[Am7]water can't co-\n[Bm7]ver her Me-\n[Em7]mory\n[C9]And\n[Am7]ashes can't an-\n[Bm7]swer her Pain\n[Em7]\n[Cmaj7]God\n[Am7]give me the po-\n[Bm7]wer to take\n[Em7]Breath from a breeze\n[C9]And call\n[Am7]life from a cold\n[Bm7]metal Frame\n\n[Bridge]\n[Em7]\n\n[Interlude]\n[D9]In with the\n[C9]ashes Or\n[G/A]up with the smoke from the\n[C9]Fire\n[Bm11]With wings up in\n[Am9]heaven Or\n[D]here, lying in\n[C9]bed\n[Bm]Palm of her hand to my\n[C9]head\n[D9]Now and forever\n[Em7]curled in my\n[Bm7]Heart And the heart of the world\n[C]\n\n[Outro]\n[Esus4]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n[Esus4]\n[Am]\n[Cmaj7]\n[Am7]\n[Em9]  [Bm7]\n[E9]",
